OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 8 MAR
OL,4,G1100FPaddy McGuinness
OL,5,     GPaddy's live from Salford with a
OL,6,     Gnew Timewarp for you to finish,
OL,7,     Gthe Weekest Link quiz and your
OL,8,     GSunday Dinners.
OL,9,G1300FElaine Paige on Sunday
OL,10,     GElaine's got a sensational
OL,11,     Gsequence of female-led show tunes
OL,12,     Gfor International Women's Day,
OL,13,     Gfrom musicals including Waitress,
OL,14,     GMade in Dagenham, Come From Away
OL,15,     Gand Sister Act.
OL,16,G1500FSounds of the 70s with Bob Harris
OL,17,     GBob marks International Women's
OL,18,     GDay with some of the decade's
OL,19,     Ggreatest female artists. His
OL,20,     G'Best of the Test' comes from
OL,21,     GBonnie Raitt on the Old Grey
OL,22,     GWhistle Test in 1976.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
